{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Admin-only WebDAV adapter for mounting a PEER's share: /files/peerdav/<peer uuid>/<path> on THIS instance speaks DAV to the local mount client (rclone, davfs2) and translates each request into peer-network calls, so nothing leaves the encrypted peer channel and the core peer proxy is not involved. OPTIONS answers locally (Allow: OPTIONS, PROPFIND, GET, HEAD, PUT, MKCOL, DELETE, COPY, MOVE). PROPFIND (Depth 0/1) runs the peer's files.propfind through peer.service.exec with href_prefix /files/peerdav/<uuid>, so hrefs point back at this mount. GET/HEAD first run a Depth 0 PROPFIND (404, collection -> 405, Content-Length and type), then GET asks the peer's peer.peer.local for /files/get_file and joins the returned peer stream as the response body. No Range support. PUT (405 on a collection or the root, 409 without a parent collection, 201 new / 204 replaced) opens a peer stream (peer.service.new_stream), pumps the request body into it in 16000-byte writes on a thread, and runs the peer's files.put_file with content {stream, size}, which joins the stream and renames the finished file into place; an empty body is sent inline. The body is whatever the listener buffered (64 MiB limit). MKCOL (405 when the target exists, 409 without a parent collection) runs the peer's files.make_collection; DELETE (recursive), COPY and MOVE run the peer's files.dav_tree, with the Destination header required to lie under the same /files/peerdav/<uuid> mount (403 otherwise) and Overwrite T/F honored (201/204/412). The peer authorizes with its own groups: reads need its files group, writes its files-write group (403 naming the group otherwise); unreachable peers answer 504, other peer failures 502. uuid `local` is a loopback onto this instance's own share for the test harness.","import":"use crate::files::files::get_file::get_file;\nuse crate::files::files::put_file::put_file;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::databytes::DataBytes;\nuse std::panic::{catch_unwind, AssertUnwindSafe};","params":[{"desc":"HTTP request method supplied by app.service.init.","name":"nn_method","type":"String"},{"desc":"Raw request path: /files/peerdav/<peer uuid>/<share-relative path>.","name":"nn_path","type":"String"},{"desc":"HTTP request headers supplied by app.service.init.","name":"nn_headers","type":"JSONObject"},{"desc":"Raw HTTP request bytes supplied by app.service.init for non-POST requests (the PROPFIND XML).","name":"nn_body","type":"Any"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"jpknvu1a1c8192cb7n1","readers":[],"time":1794360517160,"username":"system","writers":[]}